<section class="section container prose">
  <h1>About Us</h1>
  <p>Abbeyfield Societies in Scotland (ASiS) supports older people through high‑quality housing, companionship and care. We operate as a not‑for‑profit focused on dignity and independence.</p>
  <p>Each society is an independent charity, supported by a committee of volunteers, and registered with the Office of the Scottish Charity Regulator.</p>

  <h2>Our mission</h2>
  <p><em>To enhance the quality of life for older people.</em></p>

  <h2>What we believe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Older people have an important role to play among their families and their communities.</li>
    <li>Overcoming loneliness and insecurity can make all the difference to an older person’s quality of life.</li>
    <li>People have an essential part to play in helping older people within their community.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
